      text: "# Earth\r\n\r\n## Martial Arts Trainers\r\ni\r\nMove names are grouped by the same categories used in the trainer thread. Full move descriptions and mechanics are omitted.\r\nFreestyle — Duke\r\nSkills: Any non-Afterlife\r\nAdvanced Attacks: Any non-Afterlife\r\nBlocks: Any non-Afterlife\r\nKurokonwaku — Jengo\r\nMasteries: Trickster Mastery\r\nSkills: Puppetmaster\r\nAdvanced Attacks: Ear Piercer; Proximity Blast; Burrowing Beam; Spiked Ball; Eggsplosives; Shinobi Slash; Ki Trap; Sixty Second Meltdown\r\nSignature Techniques: Dance With The Devil\r\nBlocks: Mirage\r\nAkaikaru — Rej\r\nMasteries: Chained Mastery; Intensity Mastery\r\nSkills: Swift Re-Action; Speed Demon\r\nAdvanced Attacks: Firewall; Hypersonic Knockout; Naginata; Windmill Kick; Blitzkrieg; Shock Fist; Volcanic Smash; Dexterous Glaive; Shotgun Blast\r\nSignature Techniques: Delta Storm\r\nBlocks: Limb Twist\r\nAoyosumu — Carlos Calvo\r\nMasteries: Technique Mastery\r\nSkills: Close Shave; State of Zen; Inner Peace\r\nAdvanced Attacks: Straightjacket; Zen Explosion; Lights Out Strike; Braced Energy Beam; Breathtaker; Nowhere Wave; Return Fire; Swift Neck Chop; One-Arm Shoulder Throw; Push\r\nSignature Techniques: Sonic Whisper; Heavenly Execution\r\nBlocks: Impenetrable Defense\r\nHaokiru — Gielle\r\nMasteries: Eternal Mastery\r\nSkills: Martyrdom; Reserves; Survival Instinct\r\nAdvanced Attacks: Aurora Cannon; Handstand Kick; Phoenix Ash Blast; Double Arm Cannon; Indestructible Wave; Five Finger Shot; Sonic Punch; Sonic Kick\r\nSignature Techniques: Rapture; Spirit Cannon\r\nBlocks: Neutralization; Halting Stance\r\nKiihakai — Orion\r\nMasteries: Power Surge Mastery\r\nSkills: Power Boost; Power Deflection; Protective Aura\r\nAdvanced Attacks: Stray Bullet; Earthpound; Omega Beam; Sledgehammer; Orbital Cannon; Golden Arrows; Triple Torpedo; Ki Jammer\r\nSignature Techniques: Shooting Star\r\nBlocks: Too Hot To Touch; Energy Slasher\r\nMidorikatai — Tanner\r\nMasteries: Domination Mastery; Flawless Execution Mastery\r\nSkills: Against The Odds\r\nAdvanced Attacks: Big Bopper; Gut Punch; Finger Cuffs; Chokeslam; Spine Buster; Aggravated Assault; X-Attack; Rocket Fire; Overcharged Wave; Megaton Cannon; Nothing Pretty\r\nSignature Techniques: Dim Mak\r\nBlocks: Leg Vice\r\nTrainer source: https://www.tapatalk.com/groups/dragonballlegacy1/earth-martial-arts-trainers-t52.html\r\n",
